; Source: 05 On My Way.vgz
; YM2608 FM/SSG/ADPCM/rhythm on the song's own Timer B ticks: T227 = 298.851 BPM, 24 ticks per quarter (T estimated from write timing).
; Pitch = PMD note + D detune; volume changes inside notes are tied pieces (FM V, SSG v).
